<title>FINLAND: Finnish October PPI falls 1.7 pct yr/yr -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish October PPI falls 1.7 pct yr/yr -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index rose 0.3 percent in October on September, but it fell 1.7 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>			   Oct 1996    Sept 1996	Oct 1995</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth	     +0.3 pct     +0.1 pct	 +0.3 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		 -1.7 pct     -1.8 pct	 +3.4 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
